		{
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C9BDFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>两个系统和一些箱子</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>Mekanism 对海量存储的解决方案是 </grad><grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C9BDFF f=0.8>QIO</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，即量子物品编排，它像一个无线驱动阵列，可以从任何地方访问。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它不是ME网络，也不会自动合成。它的作用是存放海量物品，让你能从世界各处取用它们。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C9BDFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>这里有什么</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C9BDFF f=0.8>正中央</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>是QIO系统和它的八个驱动层级。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C9BDFF f=0.8>右侧</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>是Applied Mekanistics，它能教会你的ME网络如何储存气体。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C9BDFF f=0.8>左侧</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>是箱子、个人储物箱、纸箱和分类方块。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 这里的每个 QIO 方块都需要 Evolved Mekanism 的 {Overclocked Control Circuit} 来制作。这意味着需要铀，而铀意味着必须先完成裂变章节。"
				"{ \"text\": \"Back to Mekanism\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#3FA9C8\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"23983F4DC524B14B\" } }"
				"{ \"text\": \"Open Evolved Mekanism\", \"underlined\": \"true\", \"color\": \"#B47CFF\", \"clickEvent\": { \"action\": \"change_page\", \"value\": \"607FC85B97E241AE\" } }"
			]
			icon: "mekanism:qio_dashboard"
