		{
			dependencies: ["6412FB58E7FE363A"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C9BDFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>它们是如何契合的</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>四块方块和一叠驱动器。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C9BDFF f=0.8>QIO 驱动阵列</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 存放着驱动，物品也物理地存在于其中。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C9BDFF f=0.8>QIO 控制面板</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 是您用来搜索和拉取物品的屏幕。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C9BDFF f=0.8>QIO Importer</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将物品推入网络，而 </grad><grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C9BDFF f=0.8>QIO Exporter</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>则将其拉回。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"4. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>万物皆由</grad><grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C9BDFF f=0.8>频率</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>而非线缆相连。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>最后那部分才是重点。频率相同的方块，无论在世界何处，都属于同一个网络。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#7A5CFF to=#C9BDFF f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>它不是什么</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>没有自动合成，也没有频道管理。它专注于存储和检索，而且比模组里的任何东西都更高效、更便宜。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 便携式QIO仪表盘将整个网络置于你的物品栏中，这正是建造它的最佳理由。"
			]
			icon: "mekanism:qio_dashboard"
			id: "126E54223C67AF37"
			min_width: 350
			rewards: [{
				id: "0C4AC24B727C9963"
